  "description": "OWAJUU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H106 Dy4 N18 O30 Zn4,10(C2 H3 N1),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.215-3.734 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.58-108.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn4Dy4(L)6(pdm)2(pdmH)4]·10CH3CN·5H2O.",
